Date: Sun, 15 Nov 2026 02:22:56 -0800
Subject: [PATCH] NoCpuPartner: 2v2 worlds only form full 4-human rooms (no
 solo ever gets a CPU partner)

3-cab test 2026-11-15 02:18 PT: the results screen hangs on a cabinet whose partner
is a CPU (the Teamplay duo cleared, the solo with a game-made CPU partner hung).
OnlineMatching.NoCpuPartner (config default true): no short-handed rooms in 2v2-rule
worlds; 2-3 solos, duo + solo and lone duos wait for 4 humans or their own timeout.
Fes 1on1 / pair worlds unchanged; entries with an "N" partner are never placed.
15 new tests (145 total).

Co-authored-by: Grok Bot <grok-bot@users.noreply.github.com>
